{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "012yus_402_2_4_012_02_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:eeea6344ab8e778c5768ed7af1818416c9948de6db140ab55c43663576cacbd6",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:012yus_402_2_4_012_02_09_b:2_4_012_02_09_b:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4fb3b3cb7174383402129f39960be35a9e882b9f75e3aefd74f732663dc066be",
      "text": "喂喂，●●●●●●●●●●监督？\n我现在正在看眼镜店呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_402_2_4_012_02_09_b:2_4_012_02_09_b:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08f1c4a9a11041d978f76ec880626708c0f172089b916b1578a7f59d0e0acb60",
      "text": "我在想，会不会有像享介那样、\n也很适合我的眼镜呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_402_2_4_012_02_09_b:2_4_012_02_09_b:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3993be280662c8f1192c1b1fcc2be8ac4f777d5699f70be8beeb5edc2c3b7862",
      "text": "以时装秀的工作为契机，\n我也想去尝试各种各样的新事物了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_402_2_4_012_02_09_b:2_4_012_02_09_b:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba1d60ffeaac4cd0886a4cbdf74c5d6034315556d6d12666637807195de530cc",
      "text": "说不定，我能走出和享介不一样的\n时尚风格呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_402_2_4_012_02_09_b:2_4_012_02_09_b:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3003284820c7bd8e32e5310a64c94fb74e7456d2ad06f410b3ebfd4edf045a9",
      "text": "……所以说，监督你觉得什么样的眼镜比较好？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_402_2_4_012_02_09_b:2_4_012_02_09_b:cmd-000018:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6d49c8734c77da1766177528ddb8385023b306d94554c821c0ef7ae59a58684",
      "text": "偏圆润的\n波士顿框",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_402_2_4_012_02_09_b:2_4_012_02_09_b:cmd-000019:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53701a671a7631e4c63f3390a44492bee3dacc1505019c041ab72b80b9aaf22e",
      "text": "规整干练的\n方形框",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_402_2_4_012_02_09_b:2_4_012_02_09_b:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eef6692675d59f690cbab9f3bad9c394a8b1fcf51fb52d27aacc9947fee1eb02",
      "text": "这样啊，我知道了！\n下次工作的时候，我就戴过去！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_402_2_4_012_02_09_b:2_4_012_02_09_b:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74b1de4f0e3d9b87549019d3e958931ec1d29295d7433d85fb8d9f9cea3951fb",
      "text": "谢谢你，监督！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
